{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116056","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116056/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116056/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116056/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116056","id":3913361867,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7CU8Np","number":116056,"title":"Fix 2D glow artifacts on Forward+ renderer (regression from 4.5) (fixes #116053)","user":{"login":"jayvenn21","id":53269831,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMjY5ODMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53269831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21","html_url":"https://github.com/jayvenn21","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","color":"E94A26","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-02-08T19:15:47Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T11:21:58Z","closed_at":"2026-02-08T20:28:12Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116056","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116056","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116056.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116056.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Description\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a rendering regression in Godot 4.6 where enabling 2D glow on the Forward+ renderer produces moving white line artifacts on the left side of the viewport.\r\n\r\nThe issue:\r\n- Appears only on **Forward+**\r\n- Does **not** reproduce on the Mobile renderer\r\n- Does **not** reproduce in Godot 4.5\r\n- Is visible even in the editor and reacts to editor UI redraws\r\n- Has been observed on Intel Iris Xe (D3D12)\r\n\r\nThis strongly suggests stale or uninitialized glow buffer data being reused between frames in the 2D canvas path.\r\n\r\n### Fix\r\n\r\nThe fix ensures the 2D glow buffer is properly cleared / initialized before use when running on the Forward+ renderer, preventing residual data from previous frames or editor redraws from leaking into the output.\r\n\r\n### Reproduction\r\n\r\n1. Godot 4.6 (Forward+, D3D12)\r\n2. Node2D root\r\n3. ColorRect covering screen\r\n4. WorldEnvironment with Canvas background and glow enabled\r\n5. Observe white line artifacts on the left side of the screen\r\n6. Move mouse over editor panels — artifacts update in real time\r\n\r\n### Result\r\n\r\nArtifacts are no longer visible when using 2D glow on Forward+.\r\n\r\n### Related issue\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"jayvenn21","id":53269831,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMjY5ODMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53269831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21","html_url":"https://github.com/jayvenn21","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116056/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116056/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}